From 0244bdfbb94e67b6270cbe74d2e27b18fb274790 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "tianxu.zhang" <tianxu.zhang@bytedance.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:36:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] server: stream max-one DSML calls safely

Stream the first DSML call under parallel_tool_calls=false while keeping the final parser authoritative for closure, with explicit close metadata so argument braces remain data. Reuse the existing silence clock and emit standard empty chat chunks for OpenAI keep-alives.
